/-!
# VIII08 — the growth sandwich `R/3 ≤ Y ≤ 27R/16` and `0 < Y'/Y ≤ 3/R`

Wronskian `W = P (R Y' - Y)`:
* `P Y' = ∫₃^R V Y` (`P_mul_deriv_Y`), so `W = R ∫ - P Y`.
* `W' = Y (R V - P') = 12 Y / R²` (`W_deriv`), `W(3+) = 0` (`W_horizon`).
* `aY = Y/R`: `W = P R² aY'`, so `aY` is increasing (`aY_monotone`) and `Y ≥ R/3`.
* `aY' ≤ 4 aY /(R(R-1))` from `log(R/3) ≤ (R-3)/3`, and `aY (R/(R-1))^4` is decreasing:
  `Y ≤ 27R/16`.
* `Y' / Y ≤ 2/(R-1) ≤ 3/R` from `V ≤ 2/R` on `[3, ∞)` and `Y/z = aY(z) ≤ aY(R)`.
-/

